@BooksApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5063

### 1. Get all books
GET {{BooksApi_HostAddress}}/api/books
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get book by ID
GET {{BooksApi_HostAddress}}/api/books/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Add a new book
POST {{BooksApi_HostAddress}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "price": 29.99,
  "genre": "Software Engineering",
  "publishedYear": 2008
}

### 4. Update an existing book
PUT {{BooksApi_HostAddress}}/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Great Gatsby (Special Edition)",
  "author": "F. Scott Fitzgerald",
  "price": 14.99,
  "genre": "Classic Literature",
  "publishedYear": 1925
}

### 5. Delete a book
DELETE {{BooksApi_HostAddress}}/api/books/1
